    english: It is a fish with a flat body and both eyes on one side which hides
      on sandy or muddy ocean floors.
    korean: "\uBAB8\uC774 \uB0A9\uC791\uD558\uACE0 \uB450 \uB208\uC774 \uD55C\uCABD\uC73C\uB85C
